MASTER PROMPT — QURAN HABIT SYSTEM

A complete Quran reading habit platform

Act as a senior full-stack developer, product designer, UX researcher, and Firebase architect.

Your task is to design and build a complete, production-ready Arabic web application that helps Muslims develop and maintain a sustainable daily habit of reading the Holy Quran.

This is NOT simply an online Quran reader, a Quran completion tracker, or a motivational website.

It is a habit-building system centered around one primary objective:

Help users read the Quran consistently every day, even when they have limited time, low motivation, or a disrupted routine.

The product must combine:

* Habit formation principles.
* The Two-Minute Rule from Atomic Habits.
* Habit Stacking.
* Flexible daily reading goals.
* A traditional digital Quran (Mushaf).
* Tafsir Al-Saadi.
* Personal reading progress.
* Firebase authentication and cloud synchronization.
* Gentle browser push notifications.

Build the actual functional application, not just a static mockup.

